WEBVTT

00:04.850 --> 00:06.860
I'll tell her how I feel.

00:07.420 --> 00:09.610
Okay, here I go.

00:10.360 --> 00:13.360
What's Raven doing here, anyway?

00:15.570 --> 00:18.330
Wait, don't tell me the 
girl he likes is...

00:18.330 --> 00:19.700
Cecilia?!

00:21.210 --> 00:25.420
Oh, no! Did I just give a 
supportive nudge to a rival?!

00:25.420 --> 00:29.000
No, wait! Surely Cecilia wouldn't 
accept him that easily!

00:29.000 --> 00:33.580
Oh, but they were in the hero's 
party together, weren't they?!

00:33.580 --> 00:35.760
So maybe, just maybe...

00:46.060 --> 00:48.560
Cecilia, I'll protect you.

00:48.560 --> 00:51.090
Raven... I trust you.

00:54.610 --> 00:57.970
What if something like that happened?!

01:00.170 --> 01:01.330
Raven?

01:02.200 --> 01:03.240
How'd it go?

01:03.240 --> 01:06.750
You encouraged me, and still... I'm sorry.

01:08.950 --> 01:10.150
I'll just die.

01:13.390 --> 01:16.260
Did you forget something, Master Yoki?

01:16.670 --> 01:18.250
I just, um...

01:18.250 --> 01:20.850
I was wondering how Cecilia was doing!

01:20.850 --> 01:21.510
Pardon?

01:21.780 --> 01:24.020
I was just here to visit her!

01:24.020 --> 01:26.520
I must look so suspicious right now!

01:26.520 --> 01:29.150
Milady has retired for the night.

01:29.040 --> 01:31.770
DENIED

01:29.150 --> 01:31.300
Please come back on another day.

01:32.940 --> 01:35.030
Um, Raven was just here, wasn't he?

01:35.030 --> 01:39.280
Sir Raven? Yes, he was just here.

01:39.280 --> 01:41.390
He asked to see Happiness.

01:41.390 --> 01:42.180
Huh?

01:42.180 --> 01:44.500
The one he confessed to was...

01:44.500 --> 01:46.490
Happiness?!

03:21.700 --> 03:22.380
Hey.

03:23.610 --> 03:24.140
What?

03:24.490 --> 03:28.890
Didn't Raven... I mean, a guy 
with red hair come to see you?

03:30.190 --> 03:32.360
He's a friend of mine.

03:32.900 --> 03:35.970
He, um... told you he liked you, right?

03:35.970 --> 03:37.650
How did you answer?

03:39.240 --> 03:39.900
"Impossible."

03:40.250 --> 03:42.060
Wow, she shot him right down.

03:42.060 --> 03:44.410
I-I see. Not a chance, huh?

03:44.750 --> 03:46.620
Well, can't help it if you don't like him.

03:46.930 --> 03:47.800
No.

03:47.800 --> 03:50.180
Huh? Then why is it impossible?

03:50.540 --> 03:53.220
And where did you meet 
him in the first place?

03:53.990 --> 03:54.760
Impossible.

03:54.760 --> 03:55.810
Hey!

03:56.980 --> 03:58.310
I'll try again later.

03:59.880 --> 04:01.170
So on that note...

04:01.170 --> 04:04.610
I would like us to discuss 
Raven and Happiness!

04:04.610 --> 04:06.260
Who's Raven?

04:06.260 --> 04:08.530
A swordsman from the hero's party.

04:08.530 --> 04:09.630
Oh!

04:09.630 --> 04:12.690
That human who was 
constantly losing to you!

04:12.690 --> 04:17.010
Captain, why did you allow a 
human to get close to Happiness?

04:17.010 --> 04:20.190
Hey, relax. I didn't introduce them.

04:20.870 --> 04:25.700
I can't imagine Happiness feeling good 
about having a human say he likes her.

04:26.360 --> 04:28.010
Harpies are naturally attractive.

04:28.330 --> 04:29.900
There are countless humans

04:29.900 --> 04:33.080
who'd capture them to make them slaves 
or steal their beautiful feathers.

04:33.460 --> 04:37.040
In fact, I joined the Demon King's army

04:37.040 --> 04:40.180
after I saved Happiness when she 
was being chased by some humans.

04:40.180 --> 04:41.460
That's true.

04:41.460 --> 04:45.290
I don't think Happy actually 
hates humans, though.

04:46.020 --> 04:48.500
I mean, some humans are nice.

04:48.500 --> 04:52.730
Happy decided to be a maid because she 
liked the people in that house, right?

04:52.730 --> 04:54.470
Yeah, that's right.

04:54.790 --> 04:57.350
I get why you're concerned, Duke,

04:57.350 --> 04:59.680
but Raven isn't a bad guy.

04:59.680 --> 05:02.340
I think Happiness realizes that, too.

05:11.390 --> 05:12.020
Huh?

05:13.170 --> 05:14.640
Kramen isn't here today?

05:14.640 --> 05:15.650
Excuse me.

05:16.460 --> 05:21.460
Aren't you the gentleman I always see 
speaking with the vice guildmaster?

05:21.460 --> 05:23.450
The vice guildmaster?

05:23.790 --> 05:24.460
Yes.

05:25.420 --> 05:26.590
Uh, who?

05:26.590 --> 05:31.280
I'm talking about our 
vice guildmaster, Kramen.

05:31.280 --> 05:32.180
Huh?!

05:32.630 --> 05:35.370
He's the vice guildmaster?!

05:35.370 --> 05:36.940
Whatever.

05:38.120 --> 05:40.030
I can see why you'd react that way.

05:40.030 --> 05:41.950
So... where is he, anyway?

05:43.380 --> 05:45.910
It's a matter that could endanger 
the guild's dignity,

05:46.440 --> 05:48.950
so I can't say it too loudly, but...

05:48.950 --> 05:50.830
he's in the hospital.

05:50.830 --> 05:51.650
What?!

05:57.610 --> 05:59.760
Hey, Vice Guildmaster.

05:59.760 --> 06:01.690
What's this? You came to visit me?

06:01.690 --> 06:03.020
Well, thanks.

06:05.000 --> 06:08.480
You're hurt pretty bad. What happened?

06:08.480 --> 06:10.450
I pissed off the wife.

06:10.450 --> 06:10.970
Huh?

06:11.650 --> 06:12.970
His wife?!

06:13.540 --> 06:16.230
It was our wedding 
anniversary the other day.

06:16.680 --> 06:18.810
I was trying to choose a gift for her,

06:18.810 --> 06:21.060
but I was having trouble deciding.

06:22.980 --> 06:24.730
I wasted so much time thinking about it,

06:24.730 --> 06:26.990
I missed my chance to buy anything.

06:27.950 --> 06:30.240
And then I didn't even 
make it home for dinner,

06:30.660 --> 06:34.240
so she thought I'd forgotten 
about our anniversary...

06:37.510 --> 06:38.850
and ended up like this.

06:39.500 --> 06:41.940
Hospitalized after a fight with the wife?

06:41.940 --> 06:45.210
I can see why that would 
make the guild look bad.

06:45.620 --> 06:47.910
Your wife must be really strong.

06:48.340 --> 06:51.150
Well, she's a former A-Rank adventurer.

06:51.150 --> 06:52.350
Rank A?!

06:52.350 --> 06:53.890
As am I, by the way.

06:54.750 --> 06:56.750
We used to work as a duo.

06:57.260 --> 07:00.890
The nickname we earned as we took on 
high-ranked quests together was...

07:01.130 --> 07:03.590
the Invincible Apathy Couple.

07:03.950 --> 07:06.530
I could not be less 
envious of that nickname.

07:07.180 --> 07:10.990
I'll use healing magic on 
you to heal your wounds.

07:10.990 --> 07:11.790
No need!

07:12.410 --> 07:15.720
This is my chance to get my wife 
to nurse me back to health.

07:15.720 --> 07:16.910
Don't butt in.

07:17.190 --> 07:19.660
I'm not sure why, but... I'm sorry.

07:19.900 --> 07:22.670
How are you feeling, dear?

07:23.450 --> 07:25.130
I brought a change of clothes.

07:25.130 --> 07:26.670
Oh, Master Yoki.

07:26.670 --> 07:28.010
Sophia?!

07:28.010 --> 07:29.880
Wait, so your wife is...

07:29.880 --> 07:32.420
I've been waiting for you, honey!

07:34.030 --> 07:35.930
Who are you calling "honey"?

07:37.460 --> 07:39.430
You always call me "Sophia."

07:39.830 --> 07:41.890
I saw up your skirt.

07:41.890 --> 07:43.670
That's fine.

07:43.670 --> 07:44.350
It is?!

07:44.840 --> 07:46.860
He is my husband, after all.

07:49.700 --> 07:53.330
Thank you for coming to visit my husband.

07:53.330 --> 07:54.450
Nah, it's fine.

07:54.450 --> 07:57.660
Um, how is Cecilia doing?

07:57.660 --> 08:01.200
Her fever has gone down. 
She's all right now.

08:01.200 --> 08:02.360
Oh, good.

08:02.360 --> 08:04.670
Um... may I go see her today?

08:04.670 --> 08:08.820
She is out running various 
errands for the day.

08:08.820 --> 08:12.420
I would have preferred for her 
to rest a few more days, but...

08:12.890 --> 08:14.760
She's pretty busy, huh?

08:16.420 --> 08:17.620
So, um...

08:17.620 --> 08:18.430
Yes?

08:18.430 --> 08:22.180
I guess getting gifts is pretty 
important to girls, then?

08:23.460 --> 08:26.190
Did my husband tell you something?

08:27.090 --> 08:30.020
Oh, not really... but maybe sort of...

08:35.570 --> 08:39.330
I want to do something 
that'll make Cecilia happy.

08:40.870 --> 08:45.090
As long as your heart is truly in 
it, I'm sure she'll be pleased.

08:46.110 --> 08:49.040
Thank you! See you later!

08:55.810 --> 08:58.370
Husband and wife, huh? 
That sounds so nice.

08:58.750 --> 09:01.040
If I were to marry Cecilia...

09:01.040 --> 09:02.790
is this how it'd be?

09:02.790 --> 09:05.270
Dinner is ready, dear!

09:05.270 --> 09:06.520
Or maybe...

09:06.520 --> 09:07.990
this?

09:08.350 --> 09:11.070
I'm sorry I came home late, Yoki.

09:11.070 --> 09:13.030
I'm so hungry!

09:13.370 --> 09:16.140
Wait, why are these set 
in my previous life?!

09:19.270 --> 09:21.990
So this is the knights' dorm?

09:23.650 --> 09:24.690
Raven?

09:26.550 --> 09:27.750
I'm coming in...

09:33.910 --> 09:36.310
Are you okay? Hey.

09:39.560 --> 09:40.820
Happiness.

09:41.190 --> 09:43.550
Yoki? How do you know that name?

09:43.550 --> 09:44.850
Welcome back, Raven.

09:45.630 --> 09:47.810
I've known her for ages, actually.

09:49.070 --> 09:51.350
So I couldn't help wondering, you know?

09:52.020 --> 09:54.360
Would you mind telling 
me how this all happened?

09:55.170 --> 09:56.110
Okay.

09:57.220 --> 10:00.490
It started one day when I was 
out patrolling on my own...

10:02.990 --> 10:07.800
Hey, little lady, why 
don't you come with us?

10:12.250 --> 10:13.980
Who the hell are you?

10:13.980 --> 10:17.050
Quit staring, you scrawny little runt!

10:20.730 --> 10:24.060
Dude, he's Raven from the knight order!

10:24.060 --> 10:25.220
From the hero's party?!

10:28.460 --> 10:30.730
Tch. Let's go.

10:41.490 --> 10:42.200
Thanks.

10:42.790 --> 10:44.410
It's my job.

10:49.590 --> 10:50.710
Nice voice.

10:51.210 --> 10:51.920
What?

10:52.600 --> 10:54.920
I said, "Nice voice."

10:54.920 --> 10:58.560
Don't be crazy. It doesn't 
match how I look at all.

10:58.560 --> 10:59.850
Doesn't matter.

11:02.050 --> 11:03.430
I envy you.

11:07.960 --> 11:09.960
Thank you. Bye.

11:14.400 --> 11:17.610
The uniform she was 
wearing looked familiar.

11:17.610 --> 11:20.500
So that's why you came 
to Cecilia's mansion.

11:20.860 --> 11:22.820
You know Cecilia, too?

11:22.820 --> 11:25.830
Yeah, well... you could say that.

11:27.400 --> 11:29.270
You're amazing, Yoki.

11:29.580 --> 11:32.580
You left your home to be 
with the one you love,

11:33.010 --> 11:37.380
and you're working hard as an 
adventurer to be a man worthy of her.

11:37.380 --> 11:39.590
Yeah, something like that.

11:40.290 --> 11:41.940
Compared to you, I'm...

11:41.940 --> 11:44.970
Oh, come on! Don't be so down!

11:45.190 --> 11:49.150
Happiness is just, well... not 
great at dealing with men.

11:49.150 --> 11:52.340
Part of it comes from some past trauma.

11:53.420 --> 11:58.480
I see. I must have frightened her by 
confessing with such careless haste.

11:58.900 --> 12:01.330
I don't think that's it.

12:02.460 --> 12:04.410
It's just my baseless opinion, but...

12:05.670 --> 12:08.490
I think it's too soon to give up just yet.

12:10.600 --> 12:13.500
Okay, Raven, you and I 
are going out on the town!

12:13.850 --> 12:14.600
Huh?

12:27.020 --> 12:29.020
Aren't we a bit out of place here?

12:29.890 --> 12:31.270
It's fine, I promise.

12:35.430 --> 12:37.710
Oh, good! It's still here!

12:37.710 --> 12:40.480
I hope Cecilia will like it.

12:40.480 --> 12:42.450
Thank you very much.

12:51.950 --> 12:53.720
Looks perfect for Happiness.

12:54.450 --> 12:55.580
You think so?

12:56.010 --> 12:57.410
Why not buy it for her?

12:58.860 --> 13:02.580
Wouldn't getting a gift from a man 
she barely knows only frighten her?

13:02.580 --> 13:05.240
You just don't get it, Raven.

13:05.890 --> 13:09.320
As long as your heart is truly 
in it, it'll make her happy.

13:09.320 --> 13:12.010
C-Can I trust that?

13:12.010 --> 13:15.550
Not to mention it's a design 
Happiness would probably like.

13:24.290 --> 13:27.510
If I do have a chance to see her again...

13:32.560 --> 13:37.170
I'LL TAKE THIS.

13:33.910 --> 13:37.170
Uh... Of course. That'll be all, then?

13:37.530 --> 13:38.930
Is it a gift?

13:39.670 --> 13:42.670
He speaks in written form 
since he can't use his voice?

13:43.240 --> 13:44.980
Thank you very much.

13:44.980 --> 13:46.690
What? Swordsman?

13:48.910 --> 13:52.110
And you're the civilian I saw 
with the priestess last time.

13:52.110 --> 13:55.060
I'm impressed a couple of men would 
come here on their own.

13:55.790 --> 13:58.490
We were just picking out some gifts, okay?

13:58.490 --> 13:59.810
Yeah? For who?

14:00.130 --> 14:02.490
For the girls we love, of course!

14:03.570 --> 14:08.180
Oh? I knew you had your 
eye on the priestess,

14:08.180 --> 14:10.820
but I didn't know about the swordsman.

14:10.820 --> 14:12.080
Sorry, Raven!

14:14.410 --> 14:16.700
Still refusing to talk, I see.

14:16.700 --> 14:20.330
I know it's my own fault for laughing 
at you when we first met, but...

14:20.330 --> 14:24.460
Wait, what? She has a sharp 
tongue, but she regrets that?

14:28.370 --> 14:31.220
Let's go somewhere else. 
I want to hear more.

14:31.220 --> 14:33.740
Hey! Who said you could...

14:33.740 --> 14:37.480
WE CAN'T GET AWAY. JUST GIVE UP.

14:39.480 --> 14:43.180
Okay, we can take our time chatting here.

14:43.720 --> 14:44.980
Wait, you two...

14:45.620 --> 14:47.990
have no intention of 
talking to me, do you?

14:49.160 --> 14:52.370
It's Operation You Can't Talk 
While Eating, so Keep Quiet!

14:52.710 --> 14:54.490
Now we can't say anything.

14:54.490 --> 14:59.740
Aw... and here I was going to give 
you some intel about the priestess.

15:02.070 --> 15:03.170
Please do.

15:03.630 --> 15:04.750
How easy are you?!

15:05.860 --> 15:08.510
So? How far have you gotten 
with the priestess?

15:08.750 --> 15:12.570
Well, we're not going out or anything,

15:12.570 --> 15:16.010
and she's gotten marriage offers 
from all over the place...

15:16.040 --> 15:17.860
Like from Yuga?

15:17.860 --> 15:20.020
She said she turned him down.

15:20.360 --> 15:24.770
Of course she did. That idiot 
is constantly angering her.

15:25.330 --> 15:27.780
Like barging in when we're changing...

15:25.330 --> 15:26.900
Morning!

15:28.070 --> 15:31.530
or getting his bath time wrong 
so we run into each other...

15:28.260 --> 15:29.510
Hello!

15:32.270 --> 15:35.100
To make it worse, he's 
so popular with women

15:35.100 --> 15:37.070
that it hinders our travels.

15:40.770 --> 15:45.210
Guys, let's stay in this town one 
more night, for these ladies' sakes.

15:45.950 --> 15:47.460
Hero.

15:48.030 --> 15:52.220
You are far too loose with women.

15:54.970 --> 15:58.690
The priestess is serious trouble 
when she's angry, you know.

15:59.130 --> 16:00.860
You'd better watch yourself.

16:00.860 --> 16:01.980
G-Got it...

16:02.250 --> 16:04.730
Okay, now you tell me about the swordsman.

16:04.980 --> 16:07.700
I will defend the pure 
love in Raven's heart!

16:08.580 --> 16:11.830
Why are you making me out 
to be the villain here?!

16:11.830 --> 16:12.780
You're not?

16:13.000 --> 16:16.820
Believe it or not, I was 
hoping I could help somehow.

16:16.820 --> 16:20.410
Besides... sometimes you just want 
to talk about that stuff, y'know?

16:20.560 --> 16:23.420
YOU NEED SOME LOVE ADVICE, TOO?

16:23.420 --> 16:26.170
Th-This isn't about me or anything...

16:26.560 --> 16:28.920
YOKI'S A GUY YOU CAN DEPEND ON.

16:28.920 --> 16:30.350
Really?

16:32.610 --> 16:37.120
Okay, fine. The thing is... 
I've made Yuga hate me.

16:37.120 --> 16:40.810
Because of something that happened. 
You know, don't you, swordsman?

16:43.010 --> 16:45.440
This sounds like a pretty 
delicate subject.

16:45.690 --> 16:48.960
Hey, can you swear you 
won't tell anyone else?

16:48.960 --> 16:50.690
Sure. I promise.

16:51.570 --> 16:53.660
Our hero's party...

16:56.430 --> 16:59.460
was defeated several times 
at the Demon King's castle.

17:00.630 --> 17:03.100
Oh! Y-You were?

17:03.940 --> 17:05.170
I know that!

17:05.430 --> 17:08.130
And not even by the Demon King.

17:09.140 --> 17:12.580
The demon guarding the middle part 
of the castle was really strong.

17:12.950 --> 17:15.660
He made complete fools of us.

17:16.930 --> 17:18.360
Every time we lost,

17:18.360 --> 17:21.090
we were carried back 
to the nearest village.

17:21.530 --> 17:25.400
They were even so kind 
as to heal our wounds.

17:25.400 --> 17:26.480
It was humiliating.

17:26.480 --> 17:28.390
I know that, too!

17:28.390 --> 17:29.170
But...

17:29.930 --> 17:32.110
the thing is, we lied.

17:32.110 --> 17:33.890
We told people we turned back

17:33.890 --> 17:36.610
in the middle of the castle 
to make sure we were ready.

17:37.350 --> 17:40.200
All of their hopes were 
riding on the hero's party,

17:40.200 --> 17:43.620
so we did it to protect our honor... and 
most of all, that of Yuga's as hero.

17:45.470 --> 17:47.370
We kept losing for a month straight.

17:47.610 --> 17:49.560
The village was running low on supplies.

17:49.560 --> 17:52.700
We couldn't keep falsifying 
our reports any longer.

17:53.310 --> 17:54.790
It was all over.

17:55.160 --> 17:56.630
And then...

17:57.050 --> 17:59.390
that demon made us an offer.

17:59.390 --> 18:02.320
Leave the priestess here.

18:02.320 --> 18:06.390
Do that, and I will let 
the other three pass.

18:07.300 --> 18:10.940
I was the one who convinced the 
others to agree to his terms.

18:11.670 --> 18:16.360
I guess Yuga can't forgive me 
for making such a cruel choice.

18:16.360 --> 18:19.600
He won't say so, and 
he still acts cheerful,

18:19.600 --> 18:21.120
but I can just tell.

18:21.630 --> 18:23.780
You can't forgive me either, can you?

18:23.780 --> 18:24.620
Huh?

18:24.620 --> 18:28.690
I almost killed the priestess 
you love so much.

18:28.690 --> 18:29.800
Uh...

18:31.080 --> 18:33.650
Yoki, don't blame Mikana.

18:34.150 --> 18:36.630
You... Your voice...

18:36.630 --> 18:40.560
I'm partly to blame myself 
for not voicing my opinion.

18:40.560 --> 18:41.640
Mikana...

18:42.140 --> 18:43.340
I'm sorry.

18:45.890 --> 18:47.780
Forget blaming her.

18:47.780 --> 18:51.890
I never realized I'd created 
such a rift in the hero's party.

18:52.950 --> 18:56.710
Hey... did you guys ever 
tell Cecilia how you feel?

18:59.080 --> 19:00.970
What am I supposed to tell her?

19:00.970 --> 19:02.930
That I sacrificed our priestess

19:02.930 --> 19:08.160
to protect Yuga's honor because 
I was in love with him?

19:08.670 --> 19:12.240
I can't expect her to forgive 
me just because I say I'm sorry.

19:12.240 --> 19:15.840
So you're just going to let 
things stay awkward forever?

19:15.840 --> 19:17.950
You really want things to stay this way?

19:19.740 --> 19:22.840
Why don't you give it 
a little more thought?

19:24.300 --> 19:27.350
You're right. I can't 
leave things like this.

19:27.350 --> 19:31.600
What the heck? For having such a 
dull face, you're pretty useful.

19:31.890 --> 19:33.860
Part of that was unnecessary.

19:40.940 --> 19:44.110
I don't want things to end this way.

19:45.620 --> 19:48.250
I'm going to go see Happiness again.

19:55.880 --> 19:57.090
Oh, Captain.

19:57.330 --> 20:00.310
Huh? What are you guys doing here?

20:00.310 --> 20:04.010
Shiek insisted on seeing Celia.

20:04.010 --> 20:04.840
Who's this?

20:05.060 --> 20:06.790
Oh, this is Raven.

20:08.600 --> 20:11.980
This is the man who 
confessed to Happiness?

20:13.190 --> 20:15.560
What have you come here for?

20:15.560 --> 20:18.160
Making a move again after 
she rejected you once?

20:18.160 --> 20:19.480
That's pretty pathetic!

20:19.850 --> 20:21.720
Hey, cut it out.

20:21.720 --> 20:22.950
Sorry, Raven.

20:22.950 --> 20:25.700
Duke's known Happiness for a long time,

20:25.700 --> 20:27.490
so he worries about her.

20:27.710 --> 20:29.680
What is it you're after?

20:29.680 --> 20:34.250
I won't allow anyone to try to approach 
Happiness with evil intentions!

20:36.940 --> 20:38.540
Silence?!

20:38.540 --> 20:40.510
If you're not going to talk, then go away!

20:40.510 --> 20:45.320
I can't entrust my precious 
companion to a wimp like you!

20:45.320 --> 20:47.160
Hey! Raven is...

20:48.360 --> 20:51.350
I don't know anything about Happiness.

20:51.620 --> 20:55.600
I don't even know what I 
should do when I see her.

20:55.830 --> 20:56.980
What?!

20:57.230 --> 21:03.110
Shouldn't you say "I'll protect you" 
or "I'll make you happy" or something?

21:04.750 --> 21:07.120
Those wouldn't be my words.

21:08.770 --> 21:10.500
Oh! Happy!

21:18.830 --> 21:22.550
Then go and speak your own words to her!

21:24.340 --> 21:25.340
I will.

21:27.450 --> 21:29.090
Come on, man...

21:29.090 --> 21:30.910
I was just testing him a little.

21:31.260 --> 21:33.960
Happiness needs to think 
about this for herself, too.

21:37.380 --> 21:39.690
I'm sorry about last time.

21:42.520 --> 21:44.690
Um... here.

21:50.330 --> 21:53.450
Um... c-can...

21:54.630 --> 21:56.390
Can we be friends?

22:11.750 --> 22:13.470
If it's just friends...

22:17.330 --> 22:20.140
Thank you, Happiness.
